  "note": "2,200 real FlyWire v783 neurons, sampled across both optic lobes and central brain. Blue: optic; amber: central; violet: visual projection; pink: visual centrifugal. Simplified centreline paths in true micrometres; line thickness and colours are for visibility. The faint shell is a smoothed density envelope of this sample, not a segmented membrane. This is a small morphological sample of the whole-brain connectome, not its full synapse graph; crossing lines do not imply synapses. Approximately 800 \u00b5m across the sampled optic lobes, including lamina.",
